1
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,160
Speak.

2
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,240
Are you a rebel?

3
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,140
What is your relationship with our lord?

4
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,240
I

5
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,400
was making contact

6
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,200
with Director

7
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,200
Chu.

8
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:25,090
Lord Chu will be here to interrogate you shortly.

9
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,020
Say exactly what I taught you.

10
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,200
Hand this to her.

11
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,640
I guarantee you will live.

12
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:40,220
Assassinate the Emperor.

13
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,240
Nonsense!

14
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:42,840
Stop.

15
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,380
This really is a secret letter from a traitor

16
00:01:57,640 --> 00:02:00,160
intending to assassinate His Majesty.

17
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:02,040
Feng Xiu,

18
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,200
it's you.

19
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,200
We have both witnesses and material evidence.

20
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,330
How dare you deny it?

21
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,400
Chu Sanniang,

22
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,680
detain her on the spot.

23
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,880
I will report to Lord Zhou immediately.

24
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,160
Lord Feng.

25
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,360
How dare you block Lord Zhou's attendant?

26
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,240
Do you have a death wish?

27
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:19,900
Step aside.

28
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,120
You two,

29
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,440
come here.

30
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,360
Beast.

31
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,240
My good Commander.

32
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,240
I never thought

33
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,240
you'd see this day.

34
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,400
Disobeying a superior's orders,

35
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,530
colluding with rebels and assassins.

36
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,760
Oh.

37
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,160
Now there is one more:

38
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,160
brutally murdering a colleague.

39
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,440
With three crimes combined,

40
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,240
now,

41
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,680
you are doomed for good.

42
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,640
Chu Sanniang.

43
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:13,680
Lady Chu.

44
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,840
I served you tirelessly,

45
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,940
and always looked out for you.

46
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,680
But what about you?

47
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,120
You always looked down on me.

48
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,680
Now you know.

49
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:34,320
The entire Bingjingwu will belong to me, Feng Xiu.

50
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,120
The Tanshisi is here to take over the traitor.

51
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,360
Where is the traitor?

52
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,180
Commander Cui.

53
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,400
Chu Sanniang colluded with the traitor

54
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,000
with the intent to assassinate the Emperor.

55
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,320
And to cover for the traitor,

56
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,640
she murdered her colleagues.

57
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:52,640
All witnesses and material evidence are at the scene.

58
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,250
Please, Commander Cui,

59
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,780
investigate thoroughly.

60
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,160
Listen up, everyone.

61
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:10,320
Arrest Chu Sanniang

62
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,650
and all the rebels in the Bingjing Office.

63
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:13,560
Yes.

64
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,120
Go.

65
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,840
Hurry up and run!

66
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:19,600
Look.

67
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,279
She is in trouble indeed.

68
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,880
Brother Chaijiu,

69
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,040
we have to escape.

70
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,360
I see someone in the next cell.

71
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,890
Let's put on their clothes.

72
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,530
Find a way to knock them out.

73
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,200
You...

74
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,530
You are out already?

75
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,840
Untie me too.

76
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,520
The rebel Chu Sanniang

77
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,000
colluded with and harbored assassins,

78
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:51,000
and killed Feng Xiu and other fellow members.

79
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,400
I am ordered by Prime Minister Cai

80
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,400
to arrest the rebels.

81
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,210
Cui Hong.

82
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,770
The Bingjing Office

83
00:04:57,960 --> 00:05:01,020
is directly supervised by the Emperor for major cases.

84
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,680
Even though we both belong to the Imperial City Department,

85
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:07,280
the Bingjing Office is on equal footing with your Tanshi Office.

86
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,320
What right do you have

87
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,720
to convict me?

88
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,160
Chu Sanniang,

89
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:18,020
you, a woman, became the commander of the Bingjing Office.

90
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,240
It was the Emperor's grace

91
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,920
that set a precedent for women to serve as officials in the Song Dynasty.

92
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,920
Don't push your luck.

93
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,520
Lord Cui,

94
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:31,080
so you know the Emperor set a precedent for me.

95
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,800
My entire Chu family is fiercely loyal.

96
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:37,120
How dare you frame us?

97
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,360
If you talk about face, Lord Cui,

98
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:42,440
what kind of face do you even have?

99
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:46,260
Take them all back to the Imperial City Department prison.

100
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:53,760
Sir,

101
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:12,800
let's go.

102
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,330
Go check over there.

103
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,020
Search over there, hurry.

104
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,960
The guards are catching up.

105
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:26,960
We must leave now.

106
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,120
I'll lead the way.

107
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,930
Nothing over there.

108
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,480
Look over there.

109
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:30,760
Go.

110
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:41,400
Meng,

111
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,560
wait a moment.

112
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,520
Lord Chu can't walk anymore.

113
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,540
How are you?

114
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,200
Can you hold on?

115
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,659
Why did you save me?

116
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,020
I already told you.

117
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:53,000
If my daughter were still alive,

118
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,720
she would be about your age.

119
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,220
You really look like my daughter.

120
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,480
If you keep following me,

121
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,720
we might die together.

122
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,480
If I can keep you safe,

123
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,920
does your promise to help me find my daughter

124
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,800
still count?

125
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,120
Of course it does.

126
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,240
Sir,

127
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,080
we have to leave right now.

128
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:12,800
Meng,

129
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:14,880
since I saved your life,

130
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,480
I have a favor to ask.

131
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,200
Tell me.

132
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,240
I won't refuse.

133
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,320
I am currently

134
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,520
working for Lord Chu.

135
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,600
This is the wound medicine I carry with me.

136
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,280
Apply it to her later.

137
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,360
I...

138
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,080
I also...

139
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,800
Meng.

140
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,360
I think Lord Chu

141
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,920
is the person I'm looking for.

142
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:41,840
Please.

143
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,130
Be careful, my lord.

144
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:49,659
My lord.

145
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:50,970
There's a rock here.

146
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,520
Let's sit down and rest.

147
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,000
Be careful.

148
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,650
Are you hurt this badly?

149
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:59,140
Should we apply some medicine first?

150
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,800
Then I'll trouble you to apply medicine for Lord Chu.

151
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,200
I'll go find some firewood nearby.

152
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,400
Take good care of him.

153
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,720
Is Lord Chu a man or a woman?

154
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,640
I'll go scout the way.

155
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:17,920
Call me if you need anything.

156
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,160
I'll go with you.

157
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:19,880
Meng Qian,

158
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,440
come help.

159
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,920
Where are you going?

160
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:55,600
You and Uncle Chai dare to break out of prison?

161
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,800
Don't you want your sister-in-law and sister to live?

162
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,960
You can hardly save yourself now, my lord.

163
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,820
Yet you still want to threaten me?

164
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,680
You think I can't do anything to you?

165
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,760
I only agreed

166
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,680
to the old man,

167
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:11,010
that's why I'm applying medicine for you.

168
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,320
Otherwise, I would have run away long ago.

169
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,380
You better heal your wounds quickly.

170
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:19,120
I'm in a hurry to go home and find my sister-in-law and sister.

171
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,280
Wait.

172
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,080
Give me the belt.

173
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,200
Belt.

174
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:41,130
Go help Zhu Zitong start a fire.

175
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,520
I'm not your subordinate.

176
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:42,960
You...

177
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:55,050
I found a silk letter

178
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,320
on one of them.

179
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,210
I've been working hard for you.

180
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,600
But you?

181
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,120
You always look down on me.

182
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,800
Uncle Chai.

183
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:13,600
Come out.

184
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,250
You are very weak

185
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,120
right now.

186
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,680
So?
